WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.400
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th
grader and TV personality

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.400
affiliated with Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.740
My beloved Mama is a famous novelist,
who has even won the Aoki Laureate Prize.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.740
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.580
My former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.750
Right now, he's earnestly on the way
to becoming a fine manager.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.750
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.080
I'm Babbit.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.920
13 years old, according to some reports.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:54.260
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.930
Even so, right now, when I'm around him,
I'm relaxed for some reason.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:01.100
Tsuyoshi-kun, Aono-chan, and Mother Sasaki.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.720
...Who were divorced by Father Oki.
When he snaps, he's scary.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:09.060
"Dad, You've Been Arrested"

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.900
Magical Electricity!!

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.780
Okay! We're going to
take a 20-minute break.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.320
Yahoo! A break! Yay! Yay!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.910
Sana-chan, you're even more
lively during breaks, huh?

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.460
Want to have some tea with me?
I've got some meaty buns, too.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:29.460
Yeah, that sounds good!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.710
Oh, these are Osaka's famous
555 Butaman buns, huh?

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.460
--"I humbly accept!"
--Next up, some news about
a wildly violent ruffian.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.880
Today, around 7 p.m.,

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.550
in a shopping district near Negikubo
Train Station in Matsunami Ward...

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.550
That's pretty close to my house.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.600
...there was an incident
where a drunken middle-aged man
is said to have suddenly started

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:47.600
"Drunk Middle-aged Man Goes Berserk!!"

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.770
beating up on a group of three young men,
and was behaving in a wild fashion.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.600
An old man strikes back, huh?

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.110
Police rushed in, and the suspect
who was arrested at the scene...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.440
...was Oki lsao, age 41.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.400
Responding to an investigation by the
Matsunami police, Suspect Oki said...

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.780
It's Father Oki!!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.120
...the suspect who was arrested
at the scene was Oki lsao, age 41.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.040
Responding to an investigation by the
Matsunami police, Suspect Oki said...

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.620
It's Tsuyoshi's bald old man.
You're kidding, right?

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.380
...Oki lsao, age 41.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.170
Responding to an investigation by the
Matsunami police, Suspect Oki said,

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.340
"I couldn't stand it anymore."

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.590
It can't be...

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.510
What's wrong?

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.180
N- nothing special.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.180
I- it's nothing.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.680
You're being strange.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.660
Whoa! Oh, no! Oh, no!
I have to hurry!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:47.950
"The all-nighter done, I am feeling
well today. The tea is delicious."

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.330
Too many syllables.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.500
Good morning!
"I humbly accept this food!"

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.500
Good morning.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.840
That was delicious!
I'll be home later!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.720
Do not forget to brush
your teeth after meals.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.760
Not to worry!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:08.850
Math, Social Studies...

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.850
U- um, Tsuyoshi...

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.520
What, Mom?

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.350
You can stay home... if you want.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.190
After what your father did,

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.150
I'm worried about them
giving you a hard time at school.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:25.200
Your mother... is worried about you.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.820
Mom...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:33.160
It's okay. Me and Aono both think
of Dad as being outside the family,

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:38.460
so no matter what they might say,
it won't bother me at all.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.460
But, Tsuyoshi...

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:45.470
No problem, no problem! No problem
at all! So Mom, don't worry, okay?

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.800
Brother, let's go!

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.810
Mm-hmm. Okay, we're leaving now.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.220
We're leaving now.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.690
Be back soon...

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:58.940
Oh...

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.190
Hayama!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:08.490
Hayama, you saw the news last night, too!
That really was a surprise, huh?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.660
I was shocked, and I'm
not even related to him,

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.830
so when I thought how Tsuyoshi-kun
would surely be shocked...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:16.170
...l was beside, standing, crying,
laughing, boiling, and cooking myself!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.790
So, you felt the same way, huh Hayama?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.170
Not really.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.170
Not really?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:28.760
Then why did you come here, huh?
You really aren't being very sincere.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.770
Yo.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.520
Ah! It's Sana-chan! And Akito!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.110
Good morning!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:42.650
Huh? What are you two both doing here?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.440
Aono-chan, good morning!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.110
Good morning, Yumi-chan!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.070
Big Brother, I'm going on ahead, okay?

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.240
Mm-hmm.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.960
Ah! Could it be that you weren't
out here waiting for me,

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.120
and you just happened to be passing by?

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.000
In the middle of a secret date,
or something?

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.460
What a thing to say out of the blue!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.130
Who would ever go
on a date with this guy!?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.550
There's no way that could be possible!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.090
--That's just absurd-
--You okay?

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.840
Huh? Am I okay? What do you mean?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.220
Oh, you mean the news
yesterday, by any chance?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.140
That's why you came by?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:22.060
Geez, you two are such worrywarts.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.150
It's really no big deal.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:30.160
I mean, sure, I was surprised. After we saw
the news, we got a call from the police.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.780
From the police?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.290
We're divorced and all,

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:38.620
but apparently, the guy doesn't have
any other close relatives or anything.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.790
"The guy"? You mean your dad?

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:45.300
The guy apparently did
some incredible stuff.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.300
The following is what Tsuyoshi-kun
thinks the incredible stuff is.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.270
Something you want, Pops?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.610
Okay, all done.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:16.160
You mean, Father Oki just started hitting
them and running wild with no warning?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.660
Since way back, whenever he saw...

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.160
...piercings...

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.500
...long, brown hair...

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.830
...blond hair...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.830
...mohawks...

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.500
...cockscomb cuts...

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.840
...or guys wearing
clothespins in their ears?

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.840
...he hated them.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.260
Well sure, he'd be particular about hair.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:34.430
Even just watching TV, whenever
someone like that would come on...

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:38.720
You dumbass! What did you do to your head!?

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.900
As far as the TV thing goes,
my Pop talks to it, too.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.610
Sana-chan, come over and visit us.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.110
That might be a little weird.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.450
Weird is fine, as long as
he's not bothering anyone.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:56.620
But he was actually hitting people.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.120
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:04.130
Aw, gee... Really, don't worry about it.
That guy and I are strangers now.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:09.210
We have different last names,
and I haven't seen him once since then.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.970
Zing!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.810
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.140
Huh? What's the matter, Aya-chan?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.140
Um... um... um...

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:27.310
You'd better not go in
the classroom right now.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.320
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:32.570
"Get this!! Tsuyoshi's dad was arrested!!
It's a shocking scandal!!"

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.610
Oh, there he is!

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.070
Heh heh, I'm surprised you even came.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.280
After what happened to your old man!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.790
Hayama-san, it's just
a little joke. A joke.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:46.750
Erase it.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.460
R- right!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.340
That's okay, you don't have to erase it.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:56.470
After all, it's the truth, and it's
got nothing to do with me anymore.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.890
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.100
Uh...

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.270
I'd better erase it, huh?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:10.150
Tsuyoshi-kun, are you sure
you're okay with it?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.940
You don't need to worry about me, Aya-chan.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:15.490
In fact, I feel lucky that they
got divorced as soon as they did.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.490
Really? Is that the truth?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.370
Mm-hmm, that's the truth.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.750
Um...

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.540
Huh? Aono-chan, what's the matter?

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:34.090
Masafumi and Yuka-chan
said they heard it at home.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:37.430
They said "Aono's father is a bad man."

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.100
That's not true, right?
That isn't true, right?

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.430
Dad actually did do a bad thing.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:50.440
But still... By now, I'm sure
he's sorry for what he's done.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:54.940
You know what? Masafumi said that
I was the child of a bad father,

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.780
and so Aono is a bad girl, too.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.620
He's wrong!
That is absolutely not true.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:04.540
Aono, Big Brother, and Mom
have not done anything wrong.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.790
You can hold your head high.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:10.960
If anyone else tries to pick on you, Aono,
then Big Brother will protect you.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.630
Okay?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.630
Mm-hmm.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.840
"School is out"

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:22.140
Arrested, of all things...
Why would he do such a thing...?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.140
Excuse me...

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.470
Hurry up!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.100
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.570
Sasaki-san sure is having it rough.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:35.070
First the divorce, now this
business with the police...

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:38.110
It must be tough having
to explain it to her kids.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:47.410
I have to be strong.
I'm the oldest son, after all.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.260
You don't say. Tsuyoshi-kun is
more cheerful than you expected?

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.590
Mm-hmm, but I get the feeling
that he's overdoing it-

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.260
Ah, that's great.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.930
As it happens, the 2-hour drama
you're auditioning for today...

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:10.440
...is somewhat similar to Tsuyoshi-kun's
situation, so I was concerned.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.100
"A somewhat similar story"

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.770
First off, the lead character's
father gets arrested.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.780
The lead plays it off like he's cheerful,

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.450
but he gets picked on by everyone,

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.280
and people say bad things about his family,

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.950
and he becomes more and more depressed.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.450
That's not somewhat similar,
that's exactly similar!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:32.290
Then one day, he roams around the city.
He makes up his mind to die.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.170
T- to die?

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.260
H- he's roaming around!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.800
He wouldn't... Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:48.390
But eventually, there's a happy
ending. He meets this girl...

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.480
Don't be hasty, Tsuyoshi-kun!!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.810
S- Sana-chan, you too!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.150
Rei-kun, Sana is a girl who puts the
lives of her friends ahead of work!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.480
Tsuyoshi-kun!!

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:59.320
If you die, you won't be able
to do any flower viewing!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.490
Sana-chan, you too!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.990
Ah, what if good boys and girls
were to imitate what you're doing!?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.450
This is an anime, so we can do this.
Don't you do it for real, now.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.660
Tsuyoshi-kun!!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.500
Sana-chan!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.000
I'll be right there!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.710
I've had enough of this.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.010
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.720
I know! I'll call in backup!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:36.650
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.980
Yay! I came in first!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.320
Oh, crap! What am I doing!?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.320
Tsuyoshi-kun! You can't die!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.490
Huh? This is the police station.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.990
Why, why, why would he go to the police?

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:51.660
That should be obvious!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.000
I get it. Tsuyoshi-kun
is here to see his dad.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.340
Brother, what do we do?

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.920
Hang on, I'm thinking right now.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.680
Let's go.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.680
Are you sure, Brother?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:15.690
You want to see him?

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.520
Yes.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.360
You're Suspect Oki Isao's son?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.030
Generally speaking, yes.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:22.360
You came by yourself?

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.360
Yes.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.030
I know you've gone
to a lot of trouble,

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.490
but unfortunately, he can't see
anyone during the investigation.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.040
Um... how are the people he hit?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.960
Oh, their injuries weren't that serious.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:37.620
In any event, word is that he
was hitting them for no reason.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.250
He snapped, went berserk,
and no one could stop him.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:43.960
Is that a gift for him?

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.300
Oh, uh...

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:52.140
Let me have them. You can give him gifts,
so I'll give them to him for you.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.470
Okay.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.650
What are you two doing here?

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.820
Did you see your dad?

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:07.490
W- why would you bring
my dad up? I found...

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.700
Yeah, I found some money,
so I came to turn it in.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.660
Um, it was about a hundred million yen...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.330
Oh, that is quite the bold lie.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.330
Bye now.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.040
You're okay, right?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:24.670
Didn't I say so this morning?
Akito-kun, is your memory that poor?

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.010
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:26.670
What?

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.300
Y- you know...

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.010
If I were to say something here,

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.930
I would be the trademark anime
heroine, the simple busybody,

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.770
the "Mind your own business!
Who asked you to help!?" girl.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.980
But I'm worried,
worried about Tsuyoshi-kun,

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.270
so I want to say something like...

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:44.440
"Hold on, you're not thinking of dying,
like in that drama, are you?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.610
You can't do that!"

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.610
But I can't say that! Not when I
think about Tsuyoshi-kun's feelings.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.280
Aah, what should I do!?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.330
You just said all of that.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.630
Leave me alone, would you!?

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.300
I've done it again.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:13.680
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:17.060
I'm... I'm just like he is.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.020
Once I snap, I don't
realize what I'm doing.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.860
Sana-chan, you'd best not
come near me anymore.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.360
You don't mean that!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.820
Go ahead and snap.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.320
Once you snap, I'll chop you right away.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.450
Akito-kun...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.780
Hayama...

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.790
Thanks, Akito-kun.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:43.790
But while I may have you, Akito-kun,
he doesn't have anyone to chop him.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.050
Previously...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.800
I was there to do it for him.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.970
But he doesn't have anyone anymore, so...

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.640
Yes, he does!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:01.140
There's someone right here, isn't there?
You're here, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.640
What I mean is,

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.480
Tsuyoshi-kun, you can go over there
once in a while, and before he snaps,

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.980
"Whoosh! Bam!" you hit him
with a preventive chop!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.650
But that would be wrong to Mom.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.360
No, it wouldn't!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:18.160
Tsuyoshi-kun, I think it's great of you
to always think about your mom's feelings,

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:21.250
but still, if all you ever
do is keep it in...

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.170
I'll turn into a toad.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.670
Anyhow, divorce is a situation
between adults, right?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:33.590
Adults may have their situation,
but children have their situations, too!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.800
They may have split up,
but the dad is still the dad,

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.260
the kids are still kids,
and the mom is still the mom.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.520
Your mom is sure
to realize that in time,

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:43.270
even though it might be impossible
for her to do that right now.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.440
Sana-chan...

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:49.940
Sana-chan, your hands are so soft.
And they smell like soap...

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.280
Friendly chop!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.240
I- is this really friendly...?

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.240
Brother...

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:09.590
Um... there's something I need to tell you
about the incident that happened yesterday.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.800
Yes, Kurata-
ah, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.890
Huh? Your dad is being released tomorrow?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.060
We got a call from the police.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:26.980
They said Dad wasn't hitting them
for no reason, but that he had grounds to!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.770
"Those grounds were..."

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.360
Hey, just hand it over!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.940
You've got some pocket change, right?

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.280
N- no...

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.950
Look, just hand it over.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.960
So, it was in order to help those kids?

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:48.960
Mm-hmm. Those kids were skipping
cram school, and goofing around.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.960
If their parents found out, they would have
gotten yelled at, so they left the scene.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.760
But they re-thought things,
and talked to the police today.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:01.640
Oh yeah? I saw some kids like that
out in front of the police station.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.970
What kind of kids were they?

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:07.810
They were brother and sister,
just like Tsuyoshi-kun and Aono-chan.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.650
So that's why, huh?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:13.150
That's why the old guy snapped like he did.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:18.320
Dad was wrong to have used violence,

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:22.830
but knowing that he did it to help
someone makes me a little glad.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:27.160
Oh, no! Not just a little
glad, you can be overjoyed!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.590
♪ Thank goodness, thank
goodness, that's a relief! ♪

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.590
♪ That's a relief,
that's a relief, hotcakes! ♪

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.760
♪ They're good with honey
syrup poured on them! ♪

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.590
♪ They're also good
with ice cream on top! ♪

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.590
♪ Now I really want to eat some! ♪

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.930
I am eating them, so excuse me.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.930
♪ Anyhow, we're so relieved now! ♪

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:45.100
♪ Han-pan-pa-pan! Clap to the rhythm! ♪

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.930
♪ Lend us your hands, pa-pan-pa-pan! ♪

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.600
Sana-chan, are we still doing this?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.270
Are you going tomorrow?

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.440
To pick your old man up?

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:55.940
Of course you're going, right?

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.360
"You're not going?"

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.360
The next day...

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.780
Huh? You're not going?

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.450
I couldn't possibly go.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:10.120
Mom was brooding all last night...

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.290
Like she was in a daze...

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:17.300
But if nobody goes there when your dad is
released, he'll be lonesome, won't he?

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:22.930
Maybe. But I can't help that. Bye.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:30.390
I'm going to go, in Tsuyoshi-kun's place.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:33.610
Mm-hmm! We'll go, too. Right, Hayama?

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:34.230
No way.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.400
Why not?

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.990
Why should I have to go
pick up that bald old codger?

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.240
There's... no way... I'm going...

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.120
Don't go getting stuck
on the side of the screen!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.030
If you're going to go, then just go!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:51.620
Sorry to keep you waiting! This week's
Sana-chan! Revised Magical Angel edition!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.090
Mom?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.970
What's the matter?

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:02.630
You can go... if you want.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:07.810
Your mom was thinking
about it all last night.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.810
Tsuyoshi, you want to go
pick up your dad, don't you?

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:16.940
Go to him. Mom will be relieved if you do.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:21.650
I'll bet he will be pretty lonely,
if nobody goes there.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:24.820
You're sure? You're really sure?

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.500
I'll be back later!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.800
Do you hear something?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.470
Huh? Something like what?

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:50.310
It's not a sandstorm, and it's not
a typhoon, and it's not a tornado...

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.060
It's Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:59.190
You came after all, Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.500
Father Oki, why are you ignoring him?

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.500
Probably because Tsuyoshi
turned away from him.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.840
Why did Tsuyoshi-kun turn away?

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:23.880
Probably because he didn't
know what to say to his dad.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.180
Da- Dad...

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.600
Dad!

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.520
Dad!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.190
Dad! Dad!

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:43.860
Dad!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.530
Dad...

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.910
The apples... were good.

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.210
Dad...

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:01.380
I must... have worried you.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.260
I'm sorry.

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:10.220
Dad! Dad! Dad!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.890
Terrific! That's terrific, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:17.890
Tsuyoshi...

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:19.730
...really is...

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.730
...going to go bald in the future, huh?

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:25.240
He will not go bald!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.570
Yes, he will.

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:30.570
Hmm... He seems to take after
his dad, so he could go bald.

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:31.580
He will not go bald!

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:32.240
Yes he will.

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:33.160
Hmm...

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:34.160
He will not go bald!

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:34.830
Yes he will.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:35.500
Hmm...

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:36.830
He will not go bald!

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.040
Yes. He. Will.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:38.830
Hmm...

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.170
He will not go bald!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:09.510
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:12.510
There is a deep, troubling gap
between the boys and girls.

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:15.140
The boys and girls of 6th Grade 3rd Class
have split the classroom in half,

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:16.550
and it's all-out war!

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:20.230
Having come to this, I'm going to fight
tooth-and-nail for the girls' side!

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:22.230
But what was the reason why
we're doing this, again?

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:24.520
Next time on Kodomo
no Omocha, Episode 33,

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:27.570
the "Sad Story of Love
Drawn Into War" saga,

00:24:27.570 --> 00:24:31.530
Love Tastes Like Curry

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:35.070
We tried going with the theme
that fighting is fruitless.
